.TH sam-jail-list 1 2026-11-17 "SAM 0.1.0" "SAM - Sandboxed AppImage Manager"
.SH NAME
sam\-jail\-list \- List registered apps
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBsam\-jail list\fR [\fB\-\-search\fR] [\fB\-\-badge\fR] [\fB\-\-risk\fR] [\fB\-\-category\fR] [\fB\-\-sort\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] 
.SH DESCRIPTION
List registered apps
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-search\fR \fI<SEARCH>\fR

.TP
\fB\-\-badge\fR \fI<BADGE>\fR
Filter by badge (ready, needs\-review, compatibility\-mode, compatibility\-risk, stale, broken, unsafe, missing, protection\-missing)
.TP
\fB\-\-risk\fR \fI<RISK>\fR
Filter by risk: harmless, some\-access, think\-twice or dangerous (low, medium and high also work)
.TP
\fB\-\-category\fR \fI<CATEGORY>\fR

.TP
\fB\-\-sort\fR \fI<SORT>\fR [default: name]
Sort by: name, recent, added
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
